# The Firebase snippet for the DISPATCH board.
#
# Not a secret in Firebase's model — a web config ships inside every web app
# that uses one — but this repository is public and the database's rules are
# open, so the address in here is effectively the key to the board. Kept out of
# git and handed to the other operator directly.
info/firebaseconfig.md

# Windows shortcuts. They point at paths on one machine and mean nothing on
# another, and one left in `info/` blocks the release script's clean-tree check.
*.lnk
